00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,420
如果你还想以朋友身份一起玩  我很愿意
If you still want to hang out as friends, I'd like that.

355
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:19,040
谢了  斯图尔特  我也很愿意
Thanks, Stuart. I'd like that, too.

356
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:25,510
那小真菌就躲在你脚趾甲缝里
And the fungus is under the toenail.

357
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:42,040
回来了
Hello.

358
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,880
那个...  我...
So, um, I, uh...

359
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:50,860
我去穿了人字拖
I got flip-flops.

360
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:53,510
很好啊
Good for you.

361
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:55,950
我的妈呀  出什么事了
Oh, my God, what happened?!

362
00:15:55,950 --> 00:15:57,500
我穿上人字拖后
After I got the flip-flops,

363
00:15:57,500 --> 00:16:01,330
我发现脚背都暴露在外了
I realized that the tops of my feet were exposed, so, um,

364
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:03,270
于是我赶紧擦了防晒霜
I-I put on some sunscreen,

365
00:16:03,270 --> 00:16:05,900
结果两只脚都滑腻腻的
which caused my feet to become slippery.

366
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:08,270
不出所料  一只拖鞋从我脚上滑飞
And predictably, one of them fell off

367
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:10,720
直接掉进了下水道口
and went down a sewer grate.

368
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:13,420
按我平常的脾气  我会一走了之
Now, normally, I would have walked away,

369
00:16:13,420 --> 00:16:17,600
但作为一个全新  放松的我
but this is a new, laid-back me, so,

370
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:21,240
我没有生气  而是趴下去捡鞋
instead of getting upset, I just reached down to grab it.

371
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:25,000
然后我就摸到了某种毛茸茸的东西
That's when I touched something furry...

372
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:31,460
我说服自己那只是一顶湿假发
...which I'm telling myself was a damp toupee.

373
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:36,050
但当假发开始舔我的手时
When the toupee licked my hand...

374
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:40,630
我尖叫着
...I screamed

375
00:16:40,630 --> 00:16:45,220
单脚穿着拖鞋跳走了
and hopped down the street on my remaining flip-flop.

376
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:47,240
-我可以问问...  -不  这故事还长着呢
- Can I just ask... - No, this is a long story.

377
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:50,570
不如把问题留到最后再问吧
Why don't we please save your questions till the end?

378
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:53,790
我后来发现了一张公车站的长凳
So, I-I finally came upon a bus bench

379
00:16:53,790 --> 00:16:56,650
我在那里脱掉了我的一件衣服
where I sat and removed one of my shirts

380
00:16:56,650 --> 00:17:00,580
用它做了一只临时的鞋
and, uh, fashioned it into a makeshift shoe.

381
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:02,550
这鞋不防水
Not a waterproof shoe.

382
00:17:02,550 --> 00:17:06,340
这个细节和我接下来的故事大有关联
That is relevant to the next part of my story.

383
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:11,030
那是一坑深及脚踝的"温热金黄苹果汁"
The ankle-deep puddle of warm apple juice.

384
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:14,700
什么苹果汁
Apple juice?

385
00:17:15,020 --> 00:17:18,000
也许是  也许不是
Maybe, maybe not.

386
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:24,180
我说服了自己好多事  艾米
I'm telling myself a lot of things, Amy.

387
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:26,750
那你剩下的那只人字拖去哪里了
What happened to your other flip-flop?

388
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:30,840
那个就涉及到一块我说服自己是
Oh, well, that involves what I am telling myself was a...

389
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:34,810
融化的巧克力棒的东西了
melted candy bar.

390
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:40,320
好吧  太心疼你了
Okay. I-I'm sorry.

391
00:17:40,320 --> 00:17:42,620
我能帮你做点什么吗
Is there anything I can do to help?

392
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:47,250
有  我希望由你来负责我们的婚礼
Yes. I want you to be in charge of our wedding.

393
00:17:47,250 --> 00:17:49,210
只需把地点和时间告诉我
Just you tell me where and when,

394
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:51,200
我会佩着胸花
and I will show up with a boutonniere

395
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:54,260
穿着不露脚趾的鞋子
and close-toed shoes and a...

396
00:17:54,260 --> 00:17:58,210
还有晚礼服下的《星际迷航》制服来参加
a Star Trek uniform underneath my tuxedo.

397
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:02,870
最后这部分绝对没得商量
That last part is non-negotiable.

398
00:18:02,870 --> 00:18:05,140
你确定这是你想要的吗
Are you sure that's what you want?

399
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:08,870
就像我打算在洗手液里泡澡一样确定
As sure as I'm about to go bathe in Purell.

400
00:18:11,860 --> 00:18:14,600
-我爱你  -我也爱你
- I love you. - I love you, too.

401
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:17,850
我从小姑娘开始
You know, ever since I was a young girl,

402
00:18:18,190 --> 00:18:20,690
就一直梦想着一场六月的婚礼
I-I've dreamed of a June wedding,

403
00:18:20,690 --> 00:18:25,520
也许是在可以看到海边夕阳的悬崖边上
maybe on a cliff overlooking the ocean at sunset.

404
00:18:26,100 --> 00:18:28,030
好呀
Sure.

405
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:33,570
听起来很不错
Sounds wonderful.

406
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:37,440
现在请允许我去清洗一下
Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm going to go clean up.

407
00:18:40,990 --> 00:18:43,050
露天婚礼
Outdoor wedding.

408
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:46,850
我知道我会用那悬崖来干什么
I know what I'll be using that cliff for.

409
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:58,490
我宣布现在召开谢尔顿理事会常务会议
I call this meeting of the Council of Sheldons to order.

410
00:18:58,490 --> 00:19:00,780
开始点名
Let's take roll.

411
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:02,810
科学谢尔顿
Science Sheldon?

412
00:19:02,810 --> 00:19:04,320
到
Present.

413
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,260
德州谢尔顿
Texas Sheldon?

414
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:09,210
在这嘎达
Howdy.

415
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,720
狂热粉丝谢尔顿
Fanboy Sheldon?

416
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:14,640
向你问好
Greetings.

417
00:19:15,810 --> 00:19:17,470
洁癖谢尔顿
Germaphobe Sheldon?

418
00:19:17,470 --> 00:19:20,140
说话别喷口水
Say it, don't spray it.

419
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:25,180
运动员谢尔顿去哪里了
Where is Jock Sheldon?

420
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:29,500
现在别开玩笑  搞笑谢尔顿
Not the time, humorous Sheldon.

421
00:19:30,230 --> 00:19:32,560
新的议题
Ok, new business.

422
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:36,640
我们是否同意授予懒散谢尔顿一个理事会席位
Do we grant layback Sheldon a seat on the council?

423
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:39,840
随便你们吧
Hey, whatever you guys want.

424
00:19:40,660 --> 00:19:44,430
美国民谣歌手  获得16年诺贝尔文学奖后  拖了很久才去领奖

425
00:19:40,660 --> 00:19:44,430
我和鲍勃·迪伦一样无所谓
I'm just chill like Bob Dylan.

426
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:45,610
拒绝
Negative.

427
00:19:45,610 --> 00:19:46,690
没门
Heck no!

428
00:19:46,690 --> 00:19:49,040
我感觉不舒服
I don't feel well.

429
00:19:52,410 --> 00:19:55,100
我们能把他也踢走吗
Can we kick him out too?

